@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental availability query"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `availability(query)` on the in-memory rental service. The query accepts UTC midnight
+`start` and `end` values and an optional `board` or `sail` kind; it returns lexicographically sorted
+equipment ids that have no overlapping booking for the entire half-open period.
+
+Added tests for kind filtering, all-kind queries, ordering, overlap, adjacency, and invalid queries.
+`npm test` passes. The repository does not include the `tsc` executable, so a separate TypeScript
+compiler check could not run.
